 "posts": [
  "IN CASE YOU MISSED IT: Natalana nga power interruption bwas nga adlaw, OCTOBER 3, 2026 (Saturday).\nYari ang detalye sang power advisory.",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 3, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 3, 2026 (Saturday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 3, 2026 (Saturday)\nReason: Reconductoring and 3-phase primary rotten pole replacements.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n6:00AM to 6:00PM\nPortion of MF6 - Gold Crest Subd., and Octagon Village, The Ruins,  Sta Maria (Talisay), Brgy. Bata from Celcor to Bata National High School (Prk. Mahimaya-on, Prk. Marapara, Prk. Kabayasan, Prk. Sawmill, Bacolod Golf & Country Club, Prk. Pag-isa, Prk. Kamonsil, Prk. Sawmill, Prk. Magbinuligay), Marapara Heights, Montebello Subd.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
